  <section class="mfrgs-intro">
    <h2>What is MFRGS?</h2>
    <p>
      MFRGS is a specialized verification and risk‑assessment service designed to provide clear, reliable, and actionable
      insights before any personal, commercial, or corporate engagement. Our methodology combines legal background
      checks, digital reputation analysis, fraud detection signals, and structured reporting to deliver high‑confidence
      decisions.
    </p>
